  "result": "Excellent! **All 370 tests pass.** The renderInvoiceText enhancement is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nI've polished the `renderInvoiceText` function to provide a comprehensive invoice display with all payment and discount details.\n\n### Features Added\n\n**1. Line Discounts**\n- Shows `Discount (X%): -\u20acamount` for each line with a discount\n- Indented with 2 spaces to visually group with the line item\n- Handles decimal percentages (e.g., 12.5%)\n\n**2. Vouchers**\n- Displays `Voucher (code): -\u20acamount` just before the total\n- Only shown if a voucher is applied\n- Clear deduction line for customer transparency\n\n**3. Due Dates**\n- Shows `Due: YYYY-MM-DD` at the end\n- Present on all invoices (all have dueDate due to default NET30 terms)\n\n**4. Payment Status**\n- Shows `Paid: \u20acamount` with total of all recorded payments\n- Sums multiple payments automatically\n- Displays payment progress to customer\n\n### Display Order\nThe enhanced output follows this logical flow:\n```\nInvoice Number (or DRAFT)\nCustomer Name\nLine Item 1\n  Discount (if any)\nLine Item 2\n  Discount (if any)\nVAT: \u20acamount\nVoucher (if any): -\u20acamount\nTotal: \u20acamount\nDue: YYYY-MM-DD\nPaid: \u20acamount (if any payments)\n```\n\n### Test Coverage\n- **13 new comprehensive tests** covering:\n  - Individual line discounts with/without\n  - Multiple line discounts\n  - Voucher display\n  - Due date display\n  - Single and multiple payments\n  - Full invoice with all features combined\n  - Display order verification\n  - Indentation formatting\n\n**Test Results**: \u2705 370 of 370 tests passing",
